</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>O God of Glory, now</l><l>Appear to me;</l><l>Just as with Abraham,</l><l>Shine repeatedly.</l><l>Come, Lord, expose with light</l><l>What idols I hold tight.</l><l>Be more my heart’s delight;</l><l>Appear to me.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>When, Lord, I drag my feet,</l><l>Appear to me.</l><l>When things with Thee compete,</l><l>Lord, appear to me.</l><l>Light from Thy glorious face</l><l>Infuses me with grace</l><l>That I may run the race.</l><l>Appear to me.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Lord, as each day goes by,</l><l>Appear to me</l><l>Till face to face, so nigh,</l><l>I shall always be,</l><l>Looking away to Thee,</l><l>With eyes so lovingly,</l><l>For all eternity;</l><l>Appear to me.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
